&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in a Connectivity Operations, Solutions or Technical Partner Manager role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of hospitality/travel software; CRS,PMS, Channel Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL, Sumo Logic, Looker and Excel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tableau, Asana, Jira&amp;nbsp; and Salesforce experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid technical troubleshooting skills and project management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
