&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative skills with a proven ability to leverage data in decision-making&lt;br&gt;Adaptability to shifting priorities, projects, and deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for Airbnb, travel, and the sharing economy—being an Airbnb host is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
