&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the vision for Airbnb’s self-serve path to help millions of guests and hosts on a daily basis - delivering robust, extensible systems that enable rapid innovation, scale globally, and empower them to get help and self-solve across the multi-sided community that is Airbnb.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envision, build, and scale agentic AI capabilities and platforms to reduce friction for our guests and hosts, and deliver seamless, personalized support at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, shape, and deliver proactive support capabilities, meeting the customer where they are, and drive customer delight at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop a high-performing, globally distributed team of platform managers—cultivating a culture of innovation, inclusion, and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide key product initiatives from concept to launch, ensuring seamless integration across the support journey and measurable benefits for both users and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge strong partnerships with engineering, design, data science, product marketing, and operations to align vision, drive priorities, and ensure superior user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
