&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of platform or product leadership in technology-driven environments, including 5+ years managing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience developing and launching extensible platform capabilities at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in building delightful consumer experiences used by millions of customers globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in building AI/ML-led consumer products in complex, global operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational people leader, passionate about developing talent and fostering inclusive, high-performance teams.&lt;/li&gt;
