&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of relevant industry experience with a BS/Masters, or 2+ years with a PhD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
