&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Search and Personalization Data Science team, which drives how guests discover homes on Airbnb. Search is the core entry point to the marketplace, and our team works at the intersection of ranking systems, marketplace dynamics, and emerging AI-powered search experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build the data products, modeling frameworks, and experimentation systems that power Airbnb’s search and recommendation stack. Our work ensures search results are highly relevant for guests while supporting the long-term health of the marketplace by balancing demand, supply, and ecosystem quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team partners closely with Relevance Engineering, Product, and AI Search teams to develop new ranking approaches, evaluate product changes, and guide decision-making through rigorous measurement and modeling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will develop models, measurement frameworks, and data products that improve how listings are ranked, recommended, and discovered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will focus on three key areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop models and analytical frameworks that improve listing ranking and recommendation. This includes incorporating marketplace dynamics such as listing availability, supply quality, and long-term ecosystem health into ranking decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiments and evaluation frameworks to understand the impact of search and AI-driven product improvements. You will ensure that product decisions are grounded in rigorous measurement and causal inference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable data products and modeling pipelines that power ranking features, query understanding, and personalization. Your work will help enable the next generation of AI-powered search experiences at Airbnb.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff-level leader, you will also:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Relevance Engineering and Product to launch high-impact search improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for modeling and experimentation in Search and Personalization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other data scientists and raise the bar for building durable data products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect marketplace thinking, modeling, and experimentation across teams to guide product strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
