&lt;li&gt;9+ years of relevant industry experience and a Master’s degree or PhD in a quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fluency in Python or R for hands-on IC work and SQL for advanced data analysis at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with causal inference and machine learning techniques, ideally in a multi-sided platform setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to succeed in collaborative environments with cross-functional stakeholders and also in independent work environments&lt;/li&gt;
