&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$242,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Research has been part of Airbnb from the beginning, ever since Paul Graham told the Airbnb founders, &quot;go to your users.&quot; As designers, the founders embraced this advice and got on a plane to meet with Airbnb hosts that very weekend. Since those early days, the value of research has been baked into Airbnb’s product culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a mixed methods researcher with a strong foundation in, and passion for quantitative research in addition to an ability and comfort to flex into qualitative projects as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will use your knowledge of research design and quantitative analytical skills to plan and execute large-scale data collection, uncover insights from qualitative and quantitative data, and translate those insights into strategic and actionable recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your research will focus across methods and Airbnb’s online and offline experience—after all, most experiences with Airbnb happen when travelers are not using our digital products. And you are at the front lines of delivering insights from around the world, making Airbnb a truly global/local product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct practical and impactful quantitative research on our community of hosts and guests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uncover insights about users by using sophisticated and innovative methodologies, measurement strategies, experiments, and mixed-methods research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and share insights with product teams, other insights teams,&amp;nbsp; data scientists, marketers, policy managers, and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Masters or PhD in Psychology, Survey Science/Methods, Human-Computer Interaction, Economics, Political Science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling skills, ability to bring data and insights to life in compelling ways for varied audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with statistical analysis, modeling, experimental design, and survey design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with statistical analysis packages and (R, Stata, SPSS, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with survey programming platforms (Confirmit, Qualtrics, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting in-depth interviews and foundational qualitative methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using usability testing tools (UserTesting, dscout, outset.ai, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing projects involving cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in-house experience working in tech, hospitality, or a dual-sided marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ETL and Python&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding/scripting skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cross-cultural products or international surveys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity.&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list. If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The difference you will make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We’re looking for someone who understands TikTok at a deep, almost instinctive level.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You probably spend more time on TikTok than you’d like to admit. You spot patterns before they become trends, understand how the algorithm behaves, and have a natural feel for why some content takes off while other content disappears into the scroll.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ve likely owned or played a major role in growing a TikTok account, and you think constantly about format, storytelling, editing style, and what makes people stop, watch, and share.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Airbnb, TikTok is an opportunity to tell stories about travel, culture, and belonging in ways that feel authentic to the platform. The ideal candidate will help shape how Airbnb shows up in one of the most dynamic and culturally influential spaces on the internet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for someone who can combine creative instinct, cultural awareness, and deep platform expertise to build something distinctive - someone excited by the idea of experimenting, moving quickly, learning from the data, and helping define what TikTok can mean for Airbnb as a global brand.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You might be a great fit if you:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have&lt;/strong&gt; personally managed or significantly grown a TikTok account (for a brand, creator, or yourself)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand&lt;/strong&gt; the TikTok algorithm, trends, and formats instinctively - and can articulate why content performs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Can move&lt;/strong&gt; quickly from idea to execution, filming, editing, and publishing TikTok-native content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spot&lt;/strong&gt; cultural moments and emerging creators early and translate them into compelling brand storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have strong&lt;/strong&gt; creative instincts and are constantly thinking about how to make content more engaging, surprising, and shareable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The community you will join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Channel Communications team at Airbnb drives positive conversation, cultural relevance, and buzz across social platforms, creators, and emerging channels.We operate at the intersection of brand, culture, and storytelling - ensuring Airbnb shows up in ways that feel timely, meaningful, and distinctly our own across every consumer touchpoint.TikTok is not just another platform for us. It is a stage for creativity, personality, and cultural fluency. This role will help define how Airbnb earns attention and affinity in one of the most dynamic media environments in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A typical day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideate, conceptualize, and create TikTok-native content for Airbnb’s owned channel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with internal teams and external creators to develop original content designed specifically for TikTok&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concept, capture, edit, and publish content in real time around cultural moments and brand opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a deep and constantly evolving understanding of TikTok trends, formats, algorithm dynamics, and audience behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify creators and cultural leaders shaping the platform, translating insights into new formats, recurring series, and creative territories for Airbnb&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop original, repeatable content frameworks that move beyond trend participation and build brand equity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own accurate, timely publishing and real-time community engagement on TikTok&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead TikTok-first thinking across key campaigns and brand moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with analytics teams to measure impact, extract insights, and continuously refine strategy and creative output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8 years of experience in social media, with significant hands-on TikTok expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building and growing a highly visible brand social channel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of TikTok’s ecosystem, including formats, editing styles, algorithm behavior, and creator culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative instincts with the ability to generate original ideas quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in TikTok-native creation and editing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with creators, influencers, and production partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting high-visibility campaigns with strong cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple stakeholders and navigating fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of social listening and measurement tools such as Sprinklr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
