&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Our sales team is committed to customer centricity by focusing on understanding and meeting the unique needs and aspirations of each customer. We&#39;re seeking a driven and strategic Enterprise Account Executive who excels at expanding relationships with key customers by deepening connections with decision-makers and crafting tailored, value-driven strategies. You will join Asana’s Enterprise sales team as a trusted partner to clients and a critical contributor to our company’s growth, sharpening your sales expertise while making a meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;This role can either be fully remote depending on which US state you live in, or based in our San Francisco office with an office-centric hybrid schedule. If based in-office: The standard in-office days are Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on Wednesdays. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with which you partner. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
