&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in billing operations, finance operations, revenue operations, or a related domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of people leadership experience, including managing full-time employees and/or outsourced teams within an operations, finance, billing or related domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning end-to-end billing processes in a scaled, high-volume environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accounting, Business, Operations, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of billing processes and experience working with CRM and financial systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive process improvement initiatives, implement automation, and lead transformational projects that result in increased efficiency and reduced operational costs.&lt;/li&gt;
