&lt;li&gt;Effectively collaborate with cross-functional teams (Business Development, Product/Engineering, Finance/Tax, Compliance) and legal colleagues to solve problems, build partnerships, and close complex deals quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scaled strategies for addressing risk in business-centric ways and build commercial processes for Business Development, strategic sourcing, and vendor management that facilitate business flexibility and accelerate deal timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look around corners and creatively solve problems for the business as they plan, build, and execute their transactional and product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
