&lt;li&gt;Excellent commercial drafting and negotiation skills, judgment, analytic rigor, and business pragmatism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience structuring complex transactions and commercial agreements with strategic partners in the tech, payments, and/or finance space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management and leadership experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
