&lt;div data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;dukh8&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6rt44-0-0&quot;&gt;The Cash &amp;amp; Deposits team is improving the customer cash experience by offering trusted, easy-to-use cash balances that support traders when they choose to reduce risk. The role will focus on two areas: elevating the trust and quality of cash options, and making cash readily usable across activities such as trading, spending, and sending.&lt;/div&gt;
