&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product development for our Cash and USDC products on the main Coinbase app - improving our existing offerings, and expanding into new ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with engineering, design, compliance, legal, and operations to develop and execute against the product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launching zero to one new products for Coinbase users across existing and new Cash domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and analyze metrics to guide product development and ensure we are building a best-in-class user experience&lt;/li&gt;
