&lt;li&gt;Clearly communicate plans, progress, benefits, and functionality internally to partners and executive leadership, and externally to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;dukh8&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8t66-0-0&quot;&gt;
