&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6vv09-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy and roadmap for key staking features, protocols support, and reporting tailored for institutional clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver compliant, scalable, and performant staking solutions across multiple chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage directly with institutional clients—such as asset managers, financial institutions and crypto natives—to gather feedback, validate product direction, and ensure we’re meeting the highest bar for security, ease of use, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and manage metrics to guide product prioritization and measure success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate excitement around a shared vision and align teams to successfully realize.&lt;/li&gt;
