&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing (ie. job duties):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Senior Account Manager, you will lead and scale our most complex, multi-entity relationships across a number of segments including banks, fintechs, asset managers and corporates acting as the ultimate point of accountability for the client experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will serve as the subject matter expert for the Coinbase Prime platform, driving adoption of custody, trading, staking, and stablecoin services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will serve as the primary escalation point for complex inquiries, driving rapid resolution by orchestrating seamless coordination with internal stakeholders to uphold best in class service standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will deliver a premium onboarding experience by managing the operational integration in partnership with stakeholders. You will manage the transition from initial configuration to live production, coordinating across internal teams to ensure a sophisticated, high-velocity setup that establishes the foundation for a long-term strategic partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central connector between Sales, Trading, Legal, and Product to dismantle onboarding hurdles and execute high-stakes strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a vital feedback loop for Product and Engineering, translating complex client requirements into scalable features that shape our long-term roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales to lead technical product demonstrations, positioning yourself as the definitive specialist on Coinbase’s institutional capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a leader within the Account Management organization by mentoring junior talent and institutionalizing best practices to drive team-wide excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for in you (ie. job requirements):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates the ability to responsibly use generative AI tools and copilots (e.g., LibreChat, Gemini, Glean) in daily workflows, continuously learn as tools evolve, and apply human-in-the-loop practices to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience managing sophisticated institutional relationships within an investment bank, fintech, or digital asset firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in Mandarin is required to cover priority clients in APAC.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills with a focus on influencing outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to foster trusted and lasting relationships with clients and internal stakeholders to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of risks across key functions and workflow to identify issues and concerns.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and independent working style to enable you to manage your book of clients effectively.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience, having served as a team lead or dedicated mentor in a high-performance environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
