&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital Assets experience &amp;amp; knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive background in prime brokerage services, with a focus on clearing, custody, and financing for institutional clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
