&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to be pushed beyond what you think you’re capable of?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Coinbase, our mission is to increase economic freedom in the world. It’s a massive, ambitious opportunity that demands the best of us, every day, as we build the emerging onchain platform — and with it, the future global financial system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we’re seeking a very specific candidate. We want someone who is passionate about our mission and who believes in the power of crypto and blockchain technology to update the financial system. We want someone who is eager to leave their mark on the world, who relishes the pressure and privilege of working with high caliber colleagues, and who actively seeks feedback to keep leveling up. We want someone who will run towards, not away from, solving the company’s hardest problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/mission&quot;&gt;work culture&lt;/a&gt; is intense and isn’t for everyone. But if you want to build the future alongside others who excel in their disciplines and expect the same from you, there’s no better place to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While many roles at Coinbase are remote-first, we are not remote-only. In-person participation is required throughout the year. Team and company-wide offsites are held multiple times annually to foster collaboration, connection, and alignment. Attendance is expected and fully supported.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;fn4is&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;9v5ct-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;9v5ct-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining a small team working with Brian Armstrong, Coinbase CEO, on developing consumer‑facing AI products, with a primary focus on designing our Coinbase AI Advisor experience in the Coinbase Retail App.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing (ie. job duties):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the overall direction and decision-making for product and design strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end‑to‑end user journey for Coinbase AI Advisor across mobile and web, from first‑time activation through repeat usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex mechanics (risk, yield, trading, tax implications) into simple, high‑trust flows that help retail customers make informed decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, Research, and Legal/Compliance to define problems, explore solutions, and ship experiences quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design high‑quality UI and interaction patterns that are simple and intuitive for users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run iterative design cycles: ideate, prototype, test with users, and refine based on both qualitative research and quantitative data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for in you (ie. job requirements):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product design experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product thinking: you can take ambiguous, technical problems (AI + financial products) and turn them into clear customer journeys and flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of working within a product team to ship successful products to users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp attention to detail and mastery over your craft: visual design, interaction design, and prototyping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional communication and stakeholder management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in fast-paced (sometimes ambiguous) environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Figma and prototyping tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego, loves to collaborate, and open minded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing AI-powered products (e.g., assistants, agents, recommendation systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and experience in financial products and/or crypto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in startups, building products 0-1, and high agency / ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financially regulated products, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
