&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of making &lt;strong&gt;buy vs. build&lt;/strong&gt; decisions and driving both to successful outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple HR domains and integrating tools into productivity platforms like Slack or Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to &lt;strong&gt;drive AI-forward initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, from exploration to implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence influencing &lt;strong&gt;senior leadership, vendors, and cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt; to align around high-impact solutions&lt;/li&gt;
