&lt;li&gt;Business Platform, where we’re responsible for delivering a world-class business experience across all Coinbase products. This includes driving growth by expanding our suite of business primitives and unlocking new verticals for Coinbase, with key domains including Biz Onboarding, Enterprise IAM, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
