&lt;li&gt;Lead the path to passwordless authentication (passkeys, biometrics) and drive adoption of unphishable authentication methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own session management, device identification, and session hijacking protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Risk on account recovery flows and ATO prevention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce duplicate account creation and improve returning user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance compliance requirements (SCA, regional regulations) with user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
