&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience defining and tracking success metrics across complex funnels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance security/compliance requirements with user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering across multiple product groups without owning end-to-end UX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical aptitude to partner with engineering on session management, device identification, and authentication systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to responsibly use generative AI tools and copilots (e.g., LibreChat, Gemini, Glean) in daily workflows, continuously learn as tools evolve, and apply human-in-the-loop practices to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
