&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You have gone through a rapid growth in your company (from 10 to 100s of engineers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You’ve built financial, high reliability or security systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job #: P75194&lt;/p&gt;
