&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with S2P and spend‑management tools (e.g., Zip, Ironclad, Navan, or similar platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in high‑growth tech, fintech, or crypto environments where processes and playbooks are evolving, and/or exposure to third‑party risk management, security/privacy reviews, or other regulated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
