&lt;p&gt;The Trust &amp;amp; Loyalty org contains a portfolio of products. Our flagship offering is CB1 – Coinbase’s subscription offering and we’re creating the default crypto membership for all members of the crypto community. Currently, CB1 offers benefits such as free trading, boosted staking rates, and more. The role is on Xiaobin He&#39;s team, CB1 Growth, and the team is responsible for driving the acquisition and activation of Coinbase One subscribers. Our focus is on rapid experimentation and funnel optimization to increase sign-ups and user engagement, as well extending the reach and benefits of Coinbase One through international growth, on-chain partnerships, and strategic collaborations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing (ie. job duties):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, design and implement foundational solutions for subscription product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical structure to teams and work closely with management and stakeholders to define strategic roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage individual projects priorities, deadlines and deliverables with your technical expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and train other team members on design techniques and coding standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high quality, well tested code to meet the needs of your customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for product and operational health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for in you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve experienced architecting and developing solutions to ambiguous problems with significant impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing technical roadmap and driving organizational engineering excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling systems related to subscription/membership/promotion products, or growth levers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with growth metrics (e.g. conversion, activation, retention, engagement) and A/B testing frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates the ability to responsibly use generative AI tools and copilots (e.g., LibreChat, Gemini, Glean) in daily workflows, continuously learn as tools evolve, and apply human-in-the-loop practices to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
