&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to be pushed beyond what you think you’re capable of?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Coinbase, our mission is to increase economic freedom in the world. It’s a massive, ambitious opportunity that demands the best of us, every day, as we build the emerging onchain platform — and with it, the future global financial system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we’re seeking a very specific candidate. We want someone who is passionate about our mission and who believes in the power of crypto and blockchain technology to update the financial system. We want someone who is eager to leave their mark on the world, who relishes the pressure and privilege of working with high caliber colleagues, and who actively seeks feedback to keep leveling up. We want someone who will run towards, not away from, solving the company’s hardest problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/mission&quot;&gt;work culture&lt;/a&gt; is intense and isn’t for everyone. But if you want to build the future alongside others who excel in their disciplines and expect the same from you, there’s no better place to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While many roles at Coinbase are remote-first, we are not remote-only. In-person participation is required throughout the year. Team and company-wide offsites are held multiple times annually to foster collaboration, connection, and alignment. Attendance is expected and fully supported.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coinbase Institutional - Making the Future Real&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Without us, crypto is just a whitepaper. We make it real. Coinbase Institutional builds cutting-edge platforms that allow thousands of the world’s largest financial institutions to trade, custody, and participate in the global cryptoeconomy. From launching industry &quot;firsts&quot; to scaling secure infrastructure for hundreds of digital assets, we provide the trusted gateways for staking, governance, and web3. Whether it’s prime brokerage or international markets, we are building the scalable tech and seamless UI that empowers the biggest players on the planet to move money forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us, and build the infrastructure for what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer on the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Prime UI Platform Team&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll work on the core systems that sit underneath every frontend experience for Coinbase Prime. This includes shared frontend frameworks and components, performance and reliability, developer tooling, and backend-for-frontend APIs that powers the UI experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will drive technical architecture decisions that enable frontend teams to build blazingly fast &amp;amp; responsive UIs, and allow our frontend systems to scale reliably and securely. This includes optimizing our real-time data streams, and improving the UI experience for serving real-time market data and balances/portfolio data. You will also build developer tools that empower product teams to move with high velocity and ship reliably, quickly, frequently, and safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and own core UI platform systems used across all frontend surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in reliability, performance, and latency at the platform level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve backend-for-frontend APIs (REST/GraphQL) that serve our UI surfaces, with focus on scalability, security, and clean abstractions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead architecture and technical directions for improvements to real-time data streams (WebSocket/SSE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with frontend engineers and product teams to understand scaling pain points, and translate them into platform solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a technical multiplier: unblock teams, review high-impact changes, mentor other engineers across frontend and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable developer velocity by improving local dev, builds, CI/CD, testing, release pipelines, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for in you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience in software engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ve experienced architecting and developing solutions to ambiguous problems with significant impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’re passionate about building an open financial system that brings the world together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Nice to haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have gone through a rapid growth in your company (from 10 to 100s of engineers)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have experience with Blockchains (such as Bitcoin, Ethereum etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
