&lt;p&gt;Datadog&#39;s Finance team collaborates with teams across the organization, providing commercial, operational and analytical support to ensure that Datadog&#39;s business continues to scale rapidly and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The R&amp;amp;D Finance team enables the financial strategy behind Datadog’s Engineering and Product organizations. We partner directly with technical leadership to drive decision-making around our most critical investments. Your work will be highly cross-functional and play a pivotal role in connecting the dots across the organization through a financial lens, ensuring operational alignment and informing decision making.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we scale our infrastructure and accelerate our AI roadmap, we are hiring someone to optimize our cloud spend. This role sits at the intersection of Finance, Data Science, and Engineering. You will move beyond traditional reporting to build the predictive models and automated insights that allow us to scale efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
