&lt;p&gt;Own the end-to-end modeling for our largest hosting expense drivers (AWS, Azure, GCP, GPUs), leveraging cloud cost management tools to translate granular usage data into accurate financial forecasts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Engineering and Finance leadership to drive variance analysis, strategic capacity planning, and cost optimization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the shift from manual workflows to automated insights. You will build real-time dashboards that give Finance &amp;amp; Engineering leaders visibility into their spend without waiting for month-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Engineering to define and track unit economics and efficiency metrics; identifying specific opportunities to improve gross margin and driving them to execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee the financial performance of our AI tooling and strategic vendor partnerships, ensuring our investment scales in line with usage and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate complex technical roadmaps into clear financial narratives for the CFO and Executive leadership, ensuring capital allocation aligns with our long-term product strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become proficient with various financial planning and business intelligence (BI) tools, including but not limited to Pigment, Tableau, and Metabase.&lt;/p&gt;
