&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help the DDFS team automate processes across the full lifecycle of startup sourcing to conversion across internal tools such as Salesforce, Marketo, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
