&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5–7 years in sales engineering, solutions architecture, technical BD, forward-deployed engineer, software engineering at a SaaS/cloud company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of modern startup tech stacks, including cloud infrastructure, application frameworks, data platforms, and developer tooling&lt;/p&gt;
