&lt;li&gt;Generous and competitive&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/global-benefits/&quot;&gt; global&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/us-benefits/&quot;&gt; US benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
