&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Sales team to articulate the overall Datadog value proposition, vision and strategy to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical engagement with customers during the trial phase. Communicate Datadog’s value based on activities and work with customers on any identified issues or concerns to successful conclusion&lt;/li&gt;
