&lt;li&gt;You have experience building distributed systems and operating infrastructure with a focus on reliability and fault tolerance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a product-mindset and have comfort working with product managers and customers to scope out roadmaps and development plans. Experience doing this with new products is great to have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in a full stack environment with Go &amp;amp; TypeScript. Kubernetes and containers experience is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Machine Learning (ML) models, particularly evaluating quality and performance would be preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189eyh40 _1il9buyh _19lcevot _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;BS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;/MS/&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189eyh40 _1il9buyh _19lcevot _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;PhD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; in a Computer Science, Engineering or related scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI coding tools in day-to-day workflows and validate, critique, and refine AI-generated output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re motivated to push the boundaries of how AI can improve software engineering best practices and contribute to building AI-enabled products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
