&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2497&quot;&gt;Fluent in one or more modern coding languages (Python, Go, JavaScript, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2578&quot;&gt;Familiar with product workflows, and building security into the user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
