&lt;p&gt;Datadog Code Security is among the fastest growing security products at Datadog. With the rise of coding agents, securing customers&#39; code is becoming more important every day. You will lead Code Security teams to support our growth, expand our product suite to secure AI agents and protect customers from new agentic-based attack patterns. In this role, you will partner closely with product managers to define the Code Security roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
