&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Multiple Engineering Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and grow three teams delivering Code Security products (SAST, SCA, Secrets, and IaC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver The Product Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product managers to define the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
