&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Partner Sales Manager (PSM), you will lead Datadog’s most strategic Federal Systems Integrator (FSI) relationships, operating with a high degree of autonomy and accountability. This role is designed for a senior partner leader who can navigate complex federal sales motions, shape executive-level partner strategy, and drive material impact across Datadog’s public sector business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own a small portfolio of highly strategic, revenue-critical FSIs and be responsible for deep executive alignment, long-range joint planning, and scalable execution. Unlike earlier-stage partner roles, this position focuses on managing complexity, influencing senior stakeholders, and building durable partner motions that materially impact pipeline, revenue, and federal market expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow Datadog’s most strategic Federal Systems Integrator partnerships, operating as the primary executive point of contact and trusted advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute multi-year joint business plans with FSIs that align Datadog’s public sector priorities with partner investment, GTM strategy, and field execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forge and maintain executive-level relationships within partner organizations, influencing partner leadership, practice owners, and sales executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive complex, partner-led and partner-sourced federal opportunities by embedding FSIs deeply into account strategy, agency pursuits, and co-sell motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Datadog sales leadership to shape federal account strategy, prioritize high-impact agencies and programs, and position partners early in the buying lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and run senior-level partner operating cadences (executive QBRs, pipeline reviews, account planning) focused on measurable outcomes and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a thought leader within the partner organization, translating Datadog’s platform, roadmap, and public sector strategy into scalable partner motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a mentor and escalation point for other Partner Sales Managers, modeling best practices in executive engagement, judgment, and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in strategic alliances, channel sales, or business development within SaaS, cloud, or federal technology ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
