&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated technical knowledge through past experience (software engineering, product management, VC, etc.) or a degree in Computer Science (or equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some experience with financial modeling, forecasting, or analysis (willingness to learn; we can teach you).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excited about building and maintaining a strong network across founders, VCs, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Self-starter who thrives in fast-paced, ambiguous, and technically challenging environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent prioritization and ability to operate across multiple complex stakeholders and projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication skills and enthusiasm for developing negotiation capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
