&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow, mentor, and lead a talented and diverse team of global design managers and product designers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional partners to establish roadmaps, metrics, and goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the team to Design ahead and set the vision for the user experience to meet customer and business needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and accelerate your team, oversee multiple workstreams, and connect the dots between cross-org products for your team to deliver a cohesive customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the champion for product excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll report to the Head of Design and work with peer leaders to strengthen our processes, tools, and design organization.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15 years experience in product design with 8 years experience managing managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience and portfolio that showcases a track record of design leadership, end-to-end experience ownership, and design excellence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer advocacy with a penchant for data and business-informed design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of building complex products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of building B2B saas products is desirable but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
