&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3282&quot;&gt;You’re fluent in how design intersects with front-end technologies (HTML, CSS, React, &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;SVG&lt;/span&gt;, AI-first tooling)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
