&lt;p&gt;We’ve been fortunate to experience continued growth and investment in our channel program. With this growth we are looking to fill a critical role in our Channel team. This Datadog team is responsible for developing relationships with system integrators, resellers, and managed service providers in Brazil. As a Senior Partner Manager, you will recruit, develop, and expand our partnerships with a select list of named channel partners. These partnerships are focused on delivering new logos, deal acceleration, deal expansion, and incremental revenue growth for both Datadog and our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
