&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate the value of our platform and the market opportunity to partner with Datadog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate partner-sourced net-new sales opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand-in-hand with your channel partners, enterprise sales leaders and sellers, to accelerate and expand deals through partner value added activities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and recruit new strategic channel partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and activate channel partners through presentations, outbound outreach, in-person engagements, partnership planning, joint selling, and technical enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterback partner engagement across cross-functional teams including sales, marketing, legal, procurement, partner solutions, technical post sales, and others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host regular reviews with partners to drive accountability and report on success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
