&lt;p&gt;Datadog is seeking a Senior Product Manager to lead our efforts around OpenTelemetry Collectors, a cornerstone of our data ingestion pipeline. In this role, you&#39;ll define and deliver best-in-class collection experiences for customers leveraging OpenTelemetry — helping them receive, configure, and scale their telemetry data with confidence. This is a highly visible opportunity to shape how open standards power observability at scale, while collaborating deeply with customers, engineers, and the OpenTelemetry community. Your work will help ensure Datadog is the preferred observability destination for users to send and make sense of their OpenTelemetry data.&lt;/p&gt;
