&lt;li&gt;Lead deep troubleshooting and investigations for latency and connectivity issues, including escalations that may originate from customer support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and deliver network-related efficiency and cost-saving opportunities that positively impact business health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
