&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to lead and evolve the automation and provisioning of our networking infrastructure as Datadog continues to expand into new regions and deployment models worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
