&lt;li&gt;Experience building large-scale distributed systems in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in one or more of: Go, Rust, C++, Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are familiar with some or all of the following technologies/concepts: Cloud Networking (e.g. AWS, GCP and Azure), Kubernetes, Proxies / Load Balancers (e.g. Envoy), DNS and traffic management, Infrastructure automation tools (e.g. Terraform).&lt;/li&gt;
