&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Advise on technical support and product adoption for customers in line with pre-sales, post-sales and the renewal processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
