&lt;p&gt;Our Travel and Events team oversees the corporate travel program and internal events for Datadog.&amp;nbsp; The team helps to keep our employees safe, happy, and productive, which means every day is different. Facilitating business travel for many of our 8,000+ Datadogs around the globe, our travel program involves oversight of our airline and hotel partners as well as internal education of our travel policy. Events planned range from 50 person offsites to a 3,000+ person global sales conference including an annual sales incentive trip for some of our top performers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Travel and Events Coordinator to join us in the New York office to help us scale our travel and events globally. This role will focus on our travel and internal events initiatives, while playing an active part in supporting our growing employee base around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
