&lt;div data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;185&quot;&gt;BA/BS degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;186&quot; data-end=&quot;242&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-start=&quot;188&quot; data-end=&quot;242&quot;&gt;General knowledge of AI and its enterprise use cases&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
