&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience using AI tools such as ChatGPT or similar technologies to enhance productivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€124.200 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a highly organized, proactive Program Manager to support our Board, Senior Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(S-team),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt; and other business rhythms. This person will help drive critical business rhythms, provide high-trust operational support, and participate in a wide range of confidential and strategic initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;The right candidate is incredibly organized, proactive, and comfortable operating in ambiguity. They are humble and resourceful, able to build strong relationships across the company — including with executives — while remaining approachable and grounded. This role requires someone who can navigate shifting priorities, bring structure to complexity, and maintain a high bar for quality and follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-gz71zz89zz86zqz85zz83zsyvz122zz73zz79zz80zcs9xg1z89z2z65zsd0pz72zz73zq56z73zyl9z82zqz88zz67zz74zz85zcjz76zz80z&quot;&gt;You’ll be working in a fast-paced environment with passionate team members who are focused on quality and execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84zrnpz90zz69zz77znxz69zs4cvl1c5nlj6z77zx0cz122zz67zhg&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt; If you enjoy taming chaos while staying calm and flexible in the face of change, this role is for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;This is an individual-contributor role requiring sound judgment, discretion, and comfort working closely with senior leaders. The ideal candidate is scrappy, detail-oriented, and able to seamlessly manage change without losing sight of the details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Own quarterly Board meetings and retreats. This includes driving the agenda, creating talk tracks, partnering across the business to develop high-quality materials, and coordinating preparation and follow-ups.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Own weekly S-team meetings. This includes developing and managing the topic pipeline, shaping the agenda, coordinating with stakeholders, and documenting and tracking action items.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Create and maintain systems that support senior leadership in driving accountability and effective decision-making, including business reviews and offsites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Represent the CEO’s priorities across cross-functional initiatives, building strong relationships with stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Maintain strict confidentiality while operating in a dynamic and rapidly evolving environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Plan and execute on-site and off-site meetings and events; lead or support special projects as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot; data-highlight-color=&quot;#F7CC62&quot;&gt;5-7 years of experience in executive admin support, program management, operations, consulting, or similar fast-paced environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Comfort working directly with executives and influencing without authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills; able to shape narratives for senior audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;High integrity and discretion when handling confidential information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Resourceful, scrappy, and self-directed — able to operate independently in ambiguous situations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple priorities without dropping details&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Strong systems mindset; constantly looking for ways to improve how things work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc77rz82zz75zz87z3nwz75zz79zz78zpz86z1bmz90zqmivtz70zrv&quot;&gt;Strong Google calendar/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvuk7z83zz84zhz77zz73zz83zbz68z7z75zvz74zz86zz83z68tz89zz73zpfz76zz87z3iz77zg&quot;&gt;e-mail/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc77rz82zz75zz87z3nwz75zz79zz78zpz86z1bmz90zqmivtz70zrv&quot;&gt;do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z74z6auz79zz90z1oojz75zuoz81zz82zqtl3htmz82zz66zjkgu&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc77rz82zz75zz87z3nwz75zz79zz78zpz86z1bmz90zqmivtz70zrv&quot;&gt; skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zt2jz70zz75zz74z4z76zz90zbblhz87zz78zz88zz78z2pkz90zaj8lrtsz76zz84z&quot;&gt;Calm, composed, and solution-oriented under pressure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-338643664095391413854591 attrcomment attrcommentfirst thread-338643664095391413854591-first author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z74z6auz79zz90z1oojz75zuoz81zz82zqtl3htmz82zz66zjkgu&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;Resides in the San Francisco Bay Area and can travel to the Dropbox Studio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-338643664095391413854591 attrcomment author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvunz66z4z78z1dz79zz78zpz90z2z69z2z77z1gf3naz73zz122ze6j5sjz73z&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt; as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 2&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$117,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$158,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 3&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$104,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Role Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;At Dropbox, content designers are relied on not only for simple, helpful, and human language, but also partnership in the design process. We always bring a user-focused point of view and give input on design that goes far beyond language.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an intern eager to learn how to craft in-product content through hands-on experience. As part of the Content Design team&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx h-lparen&quot;&gt;(within&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt; our broader Design organization), you’ll work on user experiences that help millions of people do amazing work every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;In this role, you’ll meet regularly with a mentor and other content designers, and partner directly with a product team. You’ll also join Design team meetings and critiques, working closely with product designers, product managers, engineers, researchers, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Along the way, you’ll gain experience in writing, designing, researching, and iterating on user experiences to make Dropbox feel seamless and easy to use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;In our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://experience.dropbox.com/virtualfirst&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://experience.dropbox.com/virtualfirst&quot;&gt;Virtual First&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt; work culture, you’ll &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zm3h9z75zl1z87z2qdz81zz85zfisz71zp08z77zz77zez70zuu9z70zz81z&quot;&gt;connect with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;with Dropboxers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zm3h9z75zl1z87z2qdz81zz85zfisz71zp08z77zz77zez70zuu9z70zz81z&quot;&gt; virtually and in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zm3h9z75zl1z87z2qdz81zz85zfisz71zp08z77zz77zez70zuu9z70zz81z&quot;&gt;person &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;to build the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zm3h9z75zl1z87z2qdz81zz85zfisz71zp08z77zz77zez70zuu9z70zz81z&quot;&gt; foundation of a strong professional network. As a Summer intern, you will also have the opportunity to attend our Emerging Talent Summit, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zm3h9z75zl1z87z2qdz81zz85zfisz71zp08z77zz77zez70zuu9z70zz81z&quot;&gt;here &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;participants from our intern and early-career programs &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zm3h9z75zl1z87z2qdz81zz85zfisz71zp08z77zz77zez70zuu9z70zz81z&quot;&gt;come together in person to build lasting relationships,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt; explore learning and development opportunities, and prepare for their career journey ahead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;For Summer 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zm3h9z75zl1z87z2qdz81zz85zfisz71zp08z77zz77zez70zuu9z70zz81z&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;, we offer two start dates culminating in a 12-week internship:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;May 26 - August 14, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95be4z82zez76z4mvz77zz78zz81zz79zv3z70zz72zz68zuz89zz66zrz88zz76zv2z83zz77zz122z&quot;&gt;June 30 - Sep 18, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-581960479046745069416448 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Craft high-quality content that appears inside our product, including error and success messages, education, upsells, and more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
