&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz75zloz83zo2z72zz80zz80zz70zbrz68z7xbf25wobz87zivsz71z7z87zz89z&quot;&gt;Create technical user guides tailored to key departmental use cases&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz75zloz83zo2z72zz80zz80zz70zbrz68z7xbf25wobz87zivsz71z7z87zz89z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz75zloz83zo2z72zz80zz80zz70zbrz68z7xbf25wobz87zivsz71z7z87zz89z&quot;&gt; engineering, support), enabling customers, Customer Success Managers&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz75zloz83zo2z72zz80zz80zz70zbrz68z7xbf25wobz87zivsz71z7z87zz89z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(CSMs),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxvz75zloz83zo2z72zz80zz80zz70zbrz68z7xbf25wobz87zivsz71z7z87zz89z&quot;&gt; and CX support agents to drive successful product adoption, implementation, and growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
