&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are assessed at the IC2 level, below are the current Salary/OTE ranges (Subject to change):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;212,500 zł — 287,500 zł PLN&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are assessed at the IC3 level, below are the current Salary/OTE ranges (Subject to change):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;272,000 zł- — 368,000 zł PLN&lt;/p&gt;

