&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt;Experience designing, implementing, or maintaining indirect tax policies, controls, compliance, and system processes in a multi-entity or scaled environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and research skills, including the ability to interpret VAT legislation, apply technical guidance to business scenarios, and document conclusions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt;Advanced Excel proficiency&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt; data analysis, reconciliations, pivots, formulas) and a proven ability to manage projects independently from planning through execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a track record of translating complex VAT concepts into clear, concise guidance for non-tax stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, Business, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt;Experience using and implementing indirect tax technology or systems projects&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt; VAT engines, compliance/reporting tools, or tax-related system implementations, &amp;nbsp;systems enhancement projects) as part of day-to-day VAT operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4gz69zz65zkz65zz75zqk7z87zngjz66zc7tz84zz80znz69z3ttaz89zz72z3t&quot;&gt;Experience supporting process transformations or system implementations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
