&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4z67zz122z8z65zz66zz80zdz77zz65zez78zfz70zbz83zz81zz90zcz67zwz78zz74zz122zrvjz84zz80zp&quot;&gt;Ability to communicate complex technical concepts clearly and persuasively to senior engineering, product, and executive audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
