&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Dropbox &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;Business Development&lt;/span&gt; team develops and manages 3rd-party relationships on behalf of the company to deliver high-impact partnerships that generate material revenue and enable our product strategy. We work with a variety of partners, including hardware and software providers, strategic partners, and distribution partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dropbox is seeking an ambitious &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;Product and Platform Partnerships &lt;/span&gt;Manager who is passionate about technology and business strategy to own and lead a portfolio of our most strategic partnerships. In addition to relationship management and negotiation experience, this position requires critical thinking, creativity, project management, and execution skills, as you&#39;ll be called upon to conceive and drive major partner initiatives while working cross-functionally with our Product, Sales, Marketing, Legal, and Finance teams. &amp;nbsp;This individual will play a crucial role in the success of our product strategy and revenue targets by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1) &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;Building and managing thriving product partner ecosystems around new platforms and products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2) Identifying ways to find product market fit and increase reach&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt; through these product partnerships&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3) Working closely with our product team to define the future of Dropbox via AI/ML partnerships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an integral role in driving the &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;product and platform partnerships &lt;/span&gt;strategy by identifying new opportunities for partnerships across Dropbox’s current and future product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on AI/ML partnerships, both inbound &lt;span class=&quot; h-lparen&quot;&gt;(bolstering&lt;/span&gt; Dropbox’s products with AI) and outbound &lt;span class=&quot; h-lparen&quot;&gt;(integrating&lt;/span&gt; Dropbox in to other AI driven platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Product and Engineering leaders to define priorities and roadmaps and execute on the strategy for &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;partner-led or partner-involved initiatives&lt;/span&gt;. Work will include product alignment, business case, negotiations, integration development, GTM plans, and account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build joint business plans with our partners for initiatives, including end-to-end GTM plans as well as a robust set of KPIs, success metrics, joint accountability and governance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage technical and business negotiations, and partner with our legal team to develop and negotiate custom partnership agreements and repeatable templates to scale to broader ecosystem partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally and collaborate with all levels of management internally and externally to build and maintain mutually beneficial partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;+ years of experience in business development or partnership management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI/ML partnerships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hardworking &lt;span class=&quot; h-ldquo&quot;&gt;“0&lt;/span&gt; to 1 deal-maker” who has brought a number of impactful &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;product partnerships&lt;/span&gt; to life from conception to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional presentation, communication, and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at understanding and contributing to conversations with colleagues in technical functions around product specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated, self-directed, and confident individual contributor who can thrive in a dynamic environment. You maintain composure in high pressure and ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop, review and negotiate complex contracts and familiarity with standard deal structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization, prioritization, and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and analytical thinker with the ability to distill complex issues into structured frameworks and concrete plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA and/or management consulting background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$151,300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$204,700 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Dropbox &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;Business Development&lt;/span&gt; team develops and manages 3rd-party relationships on behalf of the company to deliver high-impact partnerships that generate material revenue and enable our product strategy. We work with a variety of partners, including hardware and software providers, strategic partners, and distribution partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dropbox is seeking an ambitious &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;Product and Platform Partnerships &lt;/span&gt;Manager who is passionate about technology and business strategy to own and lead a portfolio of our most strategic partnerships. In addition to relationship management and negotiation experience, this position requires critical thinking, creativity, project management, and execution skills, as you&#39;ll be called upon to conceive and drive major partner initiatives while working cross-functionally with our Product, Sales, Marketing, Legal, and Finance teams. &amp;nbsp;This individual will play a crucial role in the success of our product strategy and revenue targets by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1) &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;Building and managing thriving product partner ecosystems around new platforms and products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2) Identifying ways to find product market fit and increase reach&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt; through these product partnerships&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3) Working closely with our product team to define the future of Dropbox via AI/ML partnerships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an integral role in driving the &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;product and platform partnerships &lt;/span&gt;strategy by identifying new opportunities for partnerships across Dropbox’s current and future product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on AI/ML partnerships, both inbound &lt;span class=&quot; h-lparen&quot;&gt;(bolstering&lt;/span&gt; Dropbox’s products with AI) and outbound &lt;span class=&quot; h-lparen&quot;&gt;(integrating&lt;/span&gt; Dropbox in to other AI driven platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Product and Engineering leaders to define priorities and roadmaps and execute on the strategy for &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;partner-led or partner-involved initiatives&lt;/span&gt;. Work will include product alignment, business case, negotiations, integration development, GTM plans, and account management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build joint business plans with our partners for initiatives, including end-to-end GTM plans as well as a robust set of KPIs, success metrics, joint accountability and governance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage technical and business negotiations, and partner with our legal team to develop and negotiate custom partnership agreements and repeatable templates to scale to broader ecosystem partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally and collaborate with all levels of management internally and externally to build and maintain mutually beneficial partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;+ years of experience in business development or partnership management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI/ML partnerships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hardworking &lt;span class=&quot; h-ldquo&quot;&gt;“0&lt;/span&gt; to 1 deal-maker” who has brought a number of impactful &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz81z8nqz122zdfz68z5coz87zsz73zz76zipqu3z86zmz88zz81zcthz87zz87z&quot;&gt;product partnerships&lt;/span&gt; to life from conception to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional presentation, communication, and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at understanding and contributing to conversations with colleagues in technical functions around product specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated, self-directed, and confident individual contributor who can thrive in a dynamic environment. You maintain composure in high pressure and ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop, review and negotiate complex contracts and familiarity with standard deal structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization, prioritization, and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and analytical thinker with the ability to distill complex issues into structured frameworks and concrete plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA and/or management consulting background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;US Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This role is not available in Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 2&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$162,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$219,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 3&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$144,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Role Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Dropbox Growth team is seeking a Product Designer to create systems and experiences that measurably improve the lifecycle of our 700M+ global users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a team dedicated to craft and the creative teams that rely on Dropbox every day. Your mission will be delivering impactful user experience improvements that elevate feature adoption, utilization, and retention for key functionalities most valued by our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll collaborate closely with Product Managers to transform business challenges and product hypotheses into tangible, quantifiable, and solvable customer problems. You’ll be empowered to design effective solutions and deliver elegant user experiences through close partnership with cross-functional peers. You’ll work hand-in-hand with Engineers to bring these solutions to life, ensuring a seamless and high-quality execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact. Deliver high-quality work with a bias for action, driving meaningful customer and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Focus. Understand customer needs and validate solutions through research and usability testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interaction &amp;amp; Visual Design. Design intuitive, efficient, and accessible experiences, applying strong interaction thinking and visual craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication. Communicate clearly and proactively to ensure stakeholder alignment and informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Generation. Explore and iterate on solutions at varying levels of fidelity, informed by research, data, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Strategy &amp;amp; Decision-Making. Align design work to product strategy and business goals, engaging the right stakeholders to make timely decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft &amp;amp; Growth. Contribute to design critiques and continuously elevate quality and industry awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry &amp;amp; Innovation. Stay current on industry trends and emerging technologies, thoughtfully leveraging new tools to enhance quality, efficiency, and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zz65zz69zz77ztjrz65zz75zwz74z8yz65z6az74zt3qz89zz70zicz75zz80zw3sz81z&quot;&gt;2+ years of product design work experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zz65zz69zz77ztjrz65zz75zwz74z8yz65z6az74zt3qz89zz70zicz75zz80zw3sz81z&quot;&gt;High craft bar and attention to detail in visual design, interaction design, and prototyping.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zz65zz69zz77ztjrz65zz75zwz74z8yz65z6az74zt3qz89zz70zicz75zz80zw3sz81z&quot;&gt;Experience with common prototyping tools to demonstrate complex features and flows in web experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zz65zz69zz77ztjrz65zz75zwz74z8yz65z6az74zt3qz89zz70zicz75zz80zw3sz81z&quot;&gt;Ability to describe impact in quantitative/business metrics as well as qualitative methods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zz65zz69zz77ztjrz65zz75zwz74z8yz65z6az74zt3qz89zz70zicz75zz80zw3sz81z&quot;&gt;Experience across the product development lifecycle from discovery through shipping and iteration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zz65zz69zz77ztjrz65zz75zwz74z8yz65z6az74zt3qz89zz70zicz75zz80zw3sz81z&quot;&gt;Demonstrated skills for collaborating closely with product managers, engineers and customers in order to achieve better design outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zz65zz69zz77ztjrz65zz75zwz74z8yz65z6az74zt3qz89zz70zicz75zz80zw3sz81z&quot;&gt;Familiarity with designing for B2B SaaS products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovvz89zz65zz69zz77ztjrz65zz75zwz74z8yz65z6az74zt3qz89zz70zicz75zz80zw3sz81z&quot;&gt;Ownership mindset with a bias towards action, helping to drive teams and projects forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Poland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;189 600 zł&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;256 400 zł PLN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Role Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a senior content designer to help define the future of communication in Dropbox. This role goes beyond UX writing: You&#39;ll shape how humans and AI interact across the product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll drive content strategy, UX writing, and language systems for core Dropbox experiences, including AI-powered features used by millions of people every day. Embedded within the Core Design team, you&#39;ll work closely with product designers, product managers, engineers, and researchers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll also help establish the foundations for content at scale: reusable frameworks, governance models, and systems that ensure quality across web, mobile, and desktop as Dropbox evolves.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Define how Dropbox communicates across human- and AI-generated experiences, setting the standard for clarity, tone, and trust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Design prompt frameworks, response patterns, and interaction models that power AI features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Build reusable language systems and content architecture that support high-quality content at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Establish content governance for AI-generated experiences to ensure consistency, accuracy, and privacy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Partner with product design to shape mental models, flows, and information architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Use data, research, and experimentation to continuously improve content performance and system outputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with designers, engineers, product managers, researchers, and product marketing managers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Raise the bar for content design by contributing to team-wide systems, critiques, and craft evolution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in content design or UX writing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Experience working on or adjacent to AI-powered, automated, or conversational interfaces&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx h-lparen&quot;&gt;(i.e.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp;prompts, generated content, assistants)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Strong systems thinking: experience creating scalable frameworks like structured content, or design systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Ability to translate complex technical concepts into clear, human-centered communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Experience influencing product direction and collaborating deeply with design, product, and engineering partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to prioritize high-impact work in ambiguous, fast-evolving spaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;A portfolio of work that shows both craft and systems thinking&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx h-lparen&quot;&gt;(please&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt; include this with your application)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Experience defining or scaling language systems for large, complex products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Experience designing for AI interaction models&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx h-lparen&quot;&gt;(i.e.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt; assistants or generative interfaces)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Experience with content automation, structured content, or programmatic content generation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Experience establishing governance models or quality frameworks for content at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
