&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8oz82z8z69zz77zz73zn4gfz87z1l95vz87z0hn0oz78zkz90zz84zz89zjx&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with designers, engineers, product managers, researchers, and product marketing managers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
