&lt;li&gt;Must have worked in a &lt;em&gt;consumer&lt;/em&gt; user-facing team &lt;span class=&quot; h-lparen&quot;&gt;(versus&lt;/span&gt; a platform team, a developer-facing API-based product, etc)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
