&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to work on both 0→1 AI-powered features that shape Dropbox’s future and foundational backend systems that power reliable, performant media experiences at scale. You will operate in a fast-paced environment where we ship early, learn quickly, and iterate based on user signal—collaborating closely with Product, Design, ML, and platform teams across Dropbox.&lt;/p&gt;
