 class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80ziz71zaj3jlz67zz74zz122zz66z0dguz68zivhr4z74zh5z73z7h3az90z&quot;&gt;restoration, cleanup, and reclamation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80ziz71zaj3jlz67zz74zz122zz66z0dguz68zivhr4z74zh5z73z7h3az90z&quot;&gt; workflows, partnering across teams to deliver cohesive experiences and high-reliability systems. This role is leadership/architecture-weighted&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80ziz71zaj3jlz67zz74zz122zz66z0dguz68zivhr4z74zh5z73z7h3az90z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80ziz71zaj3jlz67zz74zz122zz66z0dguz68zivhr4z74zh5z73z7h3az90z&quot;&gt; code-heavy) and offers substantial senior-leadership exposure. You will&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;set the multi-year, multi-team technical strategy and deliver it through direct implementation or broad technical leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
