&lt;li&gt;Create social content&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvojz72zez74zz69z5z85z3uz84ztz85zfz75z5xz72zkz83zz74zz66zz86zz79zk7z69zz80zz89zz77z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(copy,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvojz72zez74zz69z5z85z3uz84ztz85zfz75z5xz72zkz83zz74zz66zz86zz79zk7z69zz80zz89zz77z&quot;&gt; scripts, visual direction) and guide stakeholder alignment and approvals, alongside Talent Brand &amp;amp; Insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full storytelling pipeline from ideation to narrative architecture to creative asset development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy, design and ongoing management of the employee advocacy program&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvojz72zez74zz69z5z85z3uz84ztz85zfz75z5xz72zkz83zz74zz66zz86zz79zk7z69zz80zz89zz77z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvojz72zez74zz69z5z85z3uz84ztz85zfz75z5xz72zkz83zz74zz66zz86zz79zk7z69zz80zz89zz77z&quot;&gt; DSMN8), empowering employees to share authentic, on-brand stories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the Talent Community engagement strategy, including newsletters, storytelling series, updates, and distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Brand &amp;amp; Insights to ensure creative is insight-backed, consistent with the Employer Value Proposition, and optimized for performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Experiential Activation to plan pre-, during-, and post-event content capture, storytelling, and amplification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvojz72zez74zz69z5z85z3uz84ztz85zfz75z5xz72zkz83zz74zz66zz86zz79zk7z69zz80zz89zz77z&quot;&gt;Poland market strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvojz72zez74zz69z5z85z3uz84ztz85zfz75z5xz72zkz83zz74zz66zz86zz79zk7z69zz80zz89zz77z&quot;&gt;, in partnership with International Recruiting and local market teams, ensuring localized creative, campaigns, and activations are culturally relevant and high-impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure narrative consistency across channels including social, career site content&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvojz72zez74zz69z5z85z3uz84ztz85zfz75z5xz72zkz83zz74zz66zz86zz79zk7z69zz80zz89zz77z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(produced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotvojz72zez74zz69z5z85z3uz84ztz85zfz75z5xz72zkz83zz74zz66zz86zz79zk7z69zz80zz89zz77z&quot;&gt; in partnership with Brand &amp;amp; Insights), events, and internal channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage creative workflows and agencies, ensuring efficiency, quality, and alignment with Dropbox brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare for AI-enabled creative scale by establishing modular and automated creative systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
