&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted partner to VP and C-suite leaders to understand business needs and align recruiting resources accordingly in order to achieve goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other recruiting leaders to develop a long term recruiting strategy globally with a goal of continuing to bring in exceptional talent to Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale a team structure that optimizes for efficiency and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve upon recruiting best practices across all orgs&lt;/li&gt;
