&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Web Development team by removing blockers and providing guidance while empowering the team to drive technical decisions across Figma.com, config.figma.com, and designsystems.com&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, manage, support, and develop a team of engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to set strategy, priorities, and mission for teams and projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex projects from start to finish—maintaining timelines, collaborator expectations, ticket triaging, and regularly presenting with teammates and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Engineering, Growth, Brand, and SEO teams to ensure reliable, performant, accessible, and secure sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a bridge between the marketing web team and our security and infrastructure groups — surfacing needs, sharing context, and facilitating cross-functional improvements through implementation and thorough documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain comprehensive testing strategies and make recommendations for the latest web technologies and improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor team members, support new hires during onboarding, and provide technical guidance to technical and non-technical collaborators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
