&lt;li&gt;Strong background in modern web architecture, including headless CMS platforms (Sanity, Contentful, Payload), caching strategies, CDN proxies, edge functions, and performance optimization across SSR and SSG environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of people management experience leading in-house web development teams, providing technical direction, mentorship, and delivery oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of web best practices spanning security (DDoS, XSS, SQL injection), database management, cloud infrastructure, CI/CD strategy, deployment processes, legal/cookie compliance, performance, and WCAG 2.2 accessibility standards&lt;/li&gt;
