&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing developer-facing or technical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in B2B SaaS and/or Enterprise software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL or comfort working with product usage data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial, product, or side-project experience in SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
