&lt;li&gt;Create and power a standout onboarding experience and program operational scale employing different technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the reporting and readout strategy, establishing a cadence for sharing insights on onboarding progress and effectiveness with leadership and cross functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create systems for insight into the curriculum that allow for scaled evolution to mirror business progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine program KPIs and leverage data to report out on new hire onboarding progress, impact to ramp time; make changes to program as necessary to deliver impact where needed&lt;/li&gt;
