&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of sales, business development, banking, business consulting, and/or account management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree from a four-year university.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad base knowledge of the sales process from lead generation to relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator is capable of handling high-profile clients (Hedge Funds, Mutual Funds, Private Equity, and Corporates).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work in a team atmosphere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to work in a fast-paced entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiative and ability to handle increasing responsibility over time.&lt;/li&gt;
