&lt;li&gt;1+ years of sales, business development, finance, banking, business consulting and/or account management experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s in finance or related degree from a four-year university.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad base knowledge of the sales process from lead generation to relationship management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator capable of handling high-profile clients (Hedge Funds, Mutual Funds, and Private Equity Firms.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work in a team atmosphere.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to work in a sales role that is KPI and metrics-driven&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
