&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability and willingness to roll-up their sleeves, jump into the work, and drive consistent execution in a fast-moving environment with a “make it happen” attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills both written and verbal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
