&lt;p&gt;The Total Rewards team strives to ensure each Stripe receives equitable and competitive compensation (cash, bonus, and equity) that is reflective of the geographies where Stripes work. We aim to align our compensation programs with Stripe’s business priorities and operating principles to attract, retain, develop, and engage our people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is looking for an equity professional to help manage and scale a world class global equity program. We’re looking for a well-rounded equity professional focused on strong customer service, commitment to accuracy, and high quality work. You’re a team player who is ready to roll up your sleeves and do the job right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the integrity and accuracy of equity data in Shareworks including the equity plan and capitalization table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately process equity activity, including grants, share issuances, RSU releases, option exercises, and stock purchase plan allocations, ensuring regulatory compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate participant data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work and collaborate with cross functional business partners (accounting, tax, payroll, compensation, legal and others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform monthly, quarterly and annual equity activity reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a user first mentality when helping Stripes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster exceptional equity participant experiences by creating presentations, answering inquiries, developing educational resources, and managing the internal equity site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop streamlined equity administration processes, system automations, and global tax compliance strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
