&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A. or B.S. Degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of equity experience at a fast growing company, preferably in both the private and public sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel, G-suite skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Function autonomously and adapt swiftly within a dynamic setting, handling duties that span equity administration, participant education, global compliance and taxation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Shareworks and ability to learn new systems quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
