&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical ability, with a track record of a “test &amp;amp; learn” mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tendency to seek and value alternate views and an ability to earn stakeholder confidence quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
