&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker, with 6+ years of work experience and a consistent track record of excellence , or similar experience in management consulting, business operations, and product management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Past experience working at the intersection of product and go-to-market teams in a software company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex, technical products and articulate their value to non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for structuring and solving highly ambiguous strategic problems and owning end-to-end execution of solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
