&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Customer master data management, Product and pricing configuration and integrations with multiple external systems for creating the data in Zuora billing and Revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Zuora subscriptions, billing, product and pricing management, Zuora revenue (ASC 606).&lt;/li&gt;
