&lt;p&gt;The Personalized Support Engineer (PSE) is a member of the Global Personalized support team supporting our top tier Personalized customers. They are responsible for handling a variety of Twilio products from Comms and Segment while also working and collaborating with the Technical Account Managers (TAMs.)&amp;nbsp; The Global PSE team advocates for our TAMs’ customers as if they are their own while providing 24x7x365 coverage, managing specializations and guarding the queue.&lt;/p&gt;
