&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to oversee health and safety programs, processes, and compliance efforts across all countries where Twilio has legal entities within the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The regional H&amp;amp;S Coordinator will report directly to the Director of Corporate Safety and Security Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular updates, reports, and recommendations on regional H&amp;amp;S matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all regional H&amp;amp;S activities, procedures, and documentation strictly follow Twilio’s global Health &amp;amp; Safety policies and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional EMEA Policy Development &amp;amp; Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, update, and standardize H&amp;amp;S policies across EMEA locations (office and remote).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with local, state, and national regulations in each location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the regional champion for the implementation and enforcement of global H&amp;amp;S initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the Health and Safety Representative for Twilio in the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Site Risk Assessments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular risk assessments at all regional EMEA Twilio locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify site-specific hazards and recommend mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct risk assessments for all regional off-site events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Awareness Programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver H&amp;amp;S training programs tailored to each site’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize regional safety workshops and awareness campaigns (If applicable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Investigation &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate incident investigations across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze trends and share Root Cause Analysis with GHS Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
