&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next Senior Manager, Enterprise Application Engineering Q2C.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will join Twilio’s Enterprise Applications Development &amp;amp; Operations organization as an Senior manager responsible for end-to-end architecture, delivery, and people leadership across Billing, AR, Collections, Cash Application, and Revenue Recognition platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role operates at the intersection of technology, finance, and leadership. You will act as a hands-on architect and strategic owner for Twilio’s Q2C ecosystem, with deep expertise in Zuora Billing, Zuora Revenue (ASC 606), CPQ integrations, and ERP accounting flows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead a team of engineers and functional specialists, partner closely with Finance, Accounting, Product, and Business Systems leaders, and ensure Twilio’s monetization platforms remain scalable, compliant, and resilient as the business grows through acquisitions, new pricing models, and global expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Platform Ownership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end architecture for Billings-to-Cash, and Revenue platforms, including Zuora Billing, Zuora Revenue, ERP, payment gateways, tax engines, and downstream reporting systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable, compliant solutions supporting subscriptions, usage-based billing, complex pricing, amendments, minimum commitments, and bundled offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the architecture authority for Q2C changes, ensuring alignment with ASC 606, SOX, audit, and internal control requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design workshops, solution walkthroughs, and architecture reviews with business and finance stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex business requirements into robust functional and technical designs, End to end scenarios, Lucid flowcharts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee delivery of enhancements, transformations, and compliance initiatives across Billing, AR, Revenue, and Cash processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive system conversions, migrations, and acquisitions onboarding into the Q2C landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high availability and operational excellence across production systems, including proactive monitoring and issue resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern integrations between Zuora, Salesforce CPQ/CRM, ERP (Oracle), tax engines, banks, payment gateways, usage mediation platforms, and reporting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion automation and straight-through processing across billing, invoicing, revenue recognition, and close processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure integrations follow enterprise integration standards, security controls, and performance benchmarks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Close, Compliance &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Accounting and Finance to support month-end close, reconciliations, audits, and regulatory reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own system readiness for ASC 606 revenue accounting, deferred revenue, allocations, and satisfaction events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable scalable reporting and analytics for Q2C KPIs, aging, revenue, and operational health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Talent Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and mentor a high-performing team of application engineers, architects, and functional SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations, career paths,cross learning&amp;nbsp; and development plans for team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, accountability, learning, and innovation&lt;br&gt;Provide coaching and hands-on guidance while scaling team capability and maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Program Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted partner to senior Finance, Accounting, IT, and Business leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional programs spanning multiple teams, vendors, and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance competing priorities while maintaining delivery quality and stakeholder trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
