&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to support the Trust, Identity &amp;amp; Compliance vertical within the Specialist Organization. In this role, you will architect and validate Twilio’s most complex, highest-impact, multi-product opportunities by translating Twilio’s portfolio into secure, scalable, and executive-ready architectures. You will operate as the regional technical authority for your specialty, partnering tightly with Generalist Solutions Engineers (SEs) and Account Executives (AEs) while engaging Enterprise Strategists and Value Engineers to accelerate outcomes. You’ll also serve as a key bridge between GTM and R&amp;amp;D—codifying repeatable architecture patterns, elevating field capability, and influencing roadmap through formal interlocks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and validate end-to-end, multi-product solutions that fit into customer ecosystems—often across multiple teams, regions, and lines of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, solution mapping, and validation strategy (workshops, demos, POCs) to remove architectural risk and secure stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope and validate architectures with emphasis on:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity verification and authentication flows (MFA, OAuth/OIDC, JWT, API-driven identity, step-up auth)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure-by-design architectures reducing fraud/abuse (signals, risk engines, rate limiting, secure enrollment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance and audit readiness (e.g., GDPR, DORA), data residency, and governance controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver exec/architect-ready presentations that communicate tradeoffs, implementation path, and long-term platform vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document customer patterns, technical shifts, and competitive signals; synthesize into actionable product feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive influence via Product &amp;amp; R&amp;amp;D interlock, GTM product escalations, and PDLC feedback mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a visible thought leader (internal/external) on trust, identity, security, fraud, and compliance trends—shaping Twilio’s point of view and technical narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
