&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to design and deliver high-impact talent development experiences for Twilions globally, driving skills development and enabling professional excellence. Acting as a strategic thought partner and program lead for flagship development initiatives, you will be a key leader in the evaluation, design, and execution of learning content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Senior Director of Talent Development, you will support the continued growth of Twilions by architecting and optimizing existing programming while evaluating new tools to empower learning teams across the organization. The ideal candidate operates at a strategic level while staying deeply involved in the details of day-to-day development optimization to enhance employee engagement and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
