&lt;li&gt;Design, lead, and evolve high-visibility talent development programs, including individual contributor offerings, aligned to business and talent strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an advisor to HRBPs and senior stakeholders to assess capability gaps and propose targeted development solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own program success end-to-end from needs assessment and instructional design (ADDIE/SAM) to global facilitation, measurement, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define a global learning content strategy and operationalize it via a Twilio-wide Learning Council to address critical skill gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply expert-level knowledge of learning science and AI to develop solutions that resonate across global audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary lead for the external learning ecosystem. This includes selecting vendors, negotiating contracts/SOWs, and ensuring the quality and integration of all outsourced learning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
