&lt;li&gt;10+ years in L&amp;amp;D, program design, and facilitation, with at least 7+ years in digital learning innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience specifically applying AI in L&amp;amp;D and 4+ years in instructional design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record managing vendor partnerships and navigating the learning tech ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with learning analytics, dashboards, and KPIs to drive data-informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
