&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with the ability to communicate project plans and development outcomes to cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing vendor partnerships in the learning tech ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating independently and making high-impact decisions in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel for in-person training (approx. one trip per quarter).&lt;/li&gt;
