&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain and review prepaid expense accounts for US entities in the general ledger, including monitoring amortization schedules and partnering with Accounts Payable and Procurement to confirm correct dates and coding when needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
