&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prepare and review payroll and related tax journal entries and account reconciliations, ensuring completeness and accuracy of payroll related activity in the general ledger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
