&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in systems engineering, automation, technical operations, RevOps, or data engineering roles within a SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating multiple systems with overlapping or conflicting data ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclination towards systems thinking, including lifecycle state modeling, eligibility logic, and auditability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating ambiguous business rules into deterministic, scalable system workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python and SQL for automation, integration logic, and data validation&lt;/li&gt;
