&lt;p&gt;As a Partner Program Manager you’ll…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Program Operations &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day operations of the Webflow Certified Partner Program, ensuring policies, benefits, and processes are executed consistently and smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage partner lifecycle workflows, onboarding, tier movement, and offboarding, with a strong focus on partner experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain program documentation, partner-facing resources, and internal playbooks to ensure clarity, accuracy, and ease of use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on partner program metrics such as applications, onboarding completion, certification progress, engagement, and activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify operational gaps or inefficiencies in the program and propose improvements that make the program easier to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Marketing, Sales, Product, and Support teams to coordinate launches, updates, and partner communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Enablement &amp;amp; Activation&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the creation and maintenance of scalable enablement resources that help partners succeed as Webflow agencies, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product education and feature updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best practices for building and delivering client sites on Webflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guidance on positioning Webflow with prospects and clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help manage and organize partner enablement content across our LMS, partner portal, and internal tools to ensure partners can easily find what they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the execution of live and virtual trainings, webinars, and office hours for partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Head of Partner Programs &amp;amp; Enablement to keep partners informed and enabled as Webflow’s product evolves quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather feedback from partners on enablement effectiveness and surface insights to inform program and content improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support certification programs and assessments that help maintain quality and consistency across the partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
