&lt;p&gt;As a People Analytics &amp;amp; Insights Analyst, you’ll…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboards &amp;amp; reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and enhance Tableau dashboards to ensure data integrity, performance, and usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support, build and improve recurring reporting processes by pulling data, validating results, running quality checks, and summarizing insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to ad-hoc analysis requests that help stakeholders answer questions about our workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data quality &amp;amp; auditing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
