&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employee listening programs, including administering and coordinating survey cycles from setup through analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with preparing survey data and initial summaries following survey completions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain documentation, SOPs, and playbooks for People Analytics processes and stakeholder enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
