&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Revenue Analytics Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to to focus on Customer Success and Partnerships analytics. This is an individual contributor role that partners closely with Customer Success, Partnerships, and RevOps Leadership to deliver actionable insights that drive retention, expansion, and revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
