&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable partnering cross functionally with Partners, Customer Success, RevOps and Data teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Care deeply about data quality, usability, and trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong business intuition around customer behavior and product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about how product signals translate into revenue and retention outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance structured analysis with responsiveness to evolving business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay curious and open to growth — actively building fluency in emerging technologies like AI to unlock creativity, accelerate progress, and amplify impact.&lt;/li&gt;
