&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;United States&amp;nbsp; (all figures cited below in USD and pertain to workers in the United States)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
