&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Document where agentic workflows break down and identify which friction is systemic vs. customer-specific&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
