&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll thrive as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Forward Deployed Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; if you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Think like a systems architect, a product strategist, and a risk mitigator&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Have strong product intuition and know when to generalize versus customize a solution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Are energized by production constraints, not frustrated by them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Know when to say &#39;no&#39; and can articulate why with clarity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Have experience with or deep curiosity about agentic AI systems, LLM orchestration, and autonomous workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
