&lt;p&gt;At Webflow, we’re building the world’s leading AI-native Digital Experience Platform, and we’re doing it as a remote-first company built on trust, transparency, and a whole lot of creativity. This work takes grit, because we move fast, without ever sacrificing craft or quality. Our mission is to bring development superpowers to everyone. From entrepreneurs launching their first idea to global enterprises scaling their digital presence, we empower teams to design, launch, and optimize for the web without barriers. We believe the future of the web, and work, is more open, more creative, and more equitable. And we’re here to build it together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Solutions Architects&lt;/strong&gt; to lead a team of SAs who help customers build, launch, and grow with Webflow by providing technical guidance, best practices, and solutions that demonstrate a deep understanding of customers’ business needs, technical needs, Webflow’s product, and trends in the industry. You will collaborate with cross-functional team members to uncover and unblock opportunities that allow customers to maximize their business value from Webflow, driving product and feature adoption and influencing product direction on their behalf.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With your technical expertise and industry knowledge you&#39;ll be able to help customers build with best practices in mind ensuring they&#39;ll build in a scalable manner and be able to grow in Webflow for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Remote-first (United States; ON, Canada)&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must reside in the Central or Eastern Time Zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exempt
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;United States&amp;nbsp; (all figures cited below are in USD and pertain to workers in the United States)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone A : $200,000 - $250,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone B: $190,000 - $237,500&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone C: $180,000 - $225,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is also eligible to participate in Webflow&#39;s company-wide bonus program. Target amounts are a percentage of base salary and vary by career level. Payouts are based on company performance against established financial and operational goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://webflow.com/careers#pay-zones&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for more information on which locations are included in each of our geographic pay zones. However, please confirm the zone for your specific location with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Information:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application deadline: applications accepted on an ongoing basis until position is closed and filled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This posting is for an existing vacancy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting to the Director, Solutions Architects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Solutions Architects&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll …&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of Solutions Architects, driving Webflow adoption and expansion through strategic guidance and strong technical partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop Solutions Architect ICs, helping them grow their technical expertise, customer engagement skills, and ability to deliver impactful solutions at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to refine the operating model for the post-sales technical journey, improving implementation guidance, launch motions, expansion plays, and customer enablement processes to drive sustained success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales, Customer Success, and Product teams to identify friction points, advocate for customer needs, and accelerate product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable playbooks and scalable processes that increase team effectiveness and ensure consistent delivery of high-quality technical guidance&lt;/li&gt;
