&lt;li&gt;Strong qualitative portfolio (at least 2 case studies showing your role, methods, synthesis, and impact).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative grounding: survey design and analysis, and comfort working with product/business metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with Data/Analytics teams and using behavioral data to sharpen research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience enabling self-serve research or elevating research practices via templates, systems, or lightweight training.&lt;/li&gt;
