&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of automation script authoring for security tasks&lt;/strong&gt; using &lt;strong&gt;Python, Go, Javascript, Typscript, or similar languages&lt;/strong&gt;. Comfortable architecting automation solutions using full stack components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable operating in &lt;strong&gt;ambiguous, fast-changing environments&lt;/strong&gt;, adapting tooling and approaches as threats and technologies evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
