&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creative direction for high-impact brand campaigns, launches, and integrated experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a core contributor and driver of Webflow&#39;s visual identity—reshaping, documenting, and shepherding its evolution across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate brand and business strategy into cohesive, story-driven creative concepts and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively shape and evolve Webflow&#39;s visual expression as the brand grows, scales, and responds to a changing landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
